#. Name of the plugin
msgid "APG Google Video Sitemap Feed"
msgstr "APG Google Video Sitemap Feed"

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Art Project Group"
msgstr "Art Project Group"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Dynamically generates a Google Video Sitemap. Compatible with WordPress Multisite installations. Created from <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/users/timbrd/\" target=\"_blank\">Tim Brandon</a> <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/google-news-sitemap-feed-with-multisite-support/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Google News Sitemap Feed With Multisite Support</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/labnol/\" target=\"_blank\">Amit Agarwal</a> <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/xml-sitemaps-for-videos/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Google XML Sitemap for Videos</strong></a> plugins. Added new functions and ideas (Vimeo and Dailymotion support) by <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ludobonnet\" target=\"_blank\">Ludo Bonnet</a>."
msgstr "Genera dinámicamente un mapa de sitio de vídeos para Google. Compatible con instalaciones de WordPress Multisite. Creado a partir del plugin <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/google-news-sitemap-feed-with-multisite-support/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Google News Sitemap Feed With Multisite Support</strong></a> de <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/users/timbrd/\" target=\"_blank\">Tim Brandon</a> y del plugin <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/xml-sitemaps-for-videos/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Google XML Sitemap for Videos</strong></a> de <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/labnol/\" target=\"_blank\">Amit Agarwal</a>. Nuevas funcionalidades e ideas (soporte para Vimeo y Dailymotion) aportadas por <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ludobonnet\" target=\"_blank\">Ludo Bonnet</a>."

